"Connect to the LDAP server using SSL (ldaps). Uses port 636 by default unless a port is specified. Ignored when LDAP host URIs are used" => "Poveži se s LDAP poslužiteljem koristeći SSL (ldaps). Prema zadanome koristi port 636 osim ako je port naveden. Ignorira se kada se koriste LDAP host URI-ji",
"Use TLS" => "Koristi TLS",
"Use STARTTLS to encrypt the LDAP connection after the initial connection is established" => "Koristi STARTTLS za enkripciju LDAP veze nakon uspostavljanja početne veze",
"LDAP Bind Type" => "Tip LDAP bind-a",
"<ul><li><b>Active Directory bind</b> will build a RDN like username@example.com where your basedn is (dc=example, dc=com) and username is your username</li><li><b>Plain bind</b> will build a RDN username</li><li><b>Full bind</b> will build a RDN like userattr=username, userdn, basedn where userattr is replaced with the value you put in ‘User attribute’, userdn with the value you put in ‘User DN’, basedn with the value with the value you put in ‘base DN’</li><li><b>OpenLDAP bind</b> will build a RDN like cn=username, basedn</li><li><b>Anonymous bind</b> will build an empty RDN</li></ul>" => "<ul><li><b>Active Directory bind</b> izgradit će RDN kao username@example.com gdje je vaš basedn (dc=example, dc=com) a username je vaše korisničko ime</li><li><b>Plain bind</b> izgradit će RDN username</li><li><b>Full bind</b> izgradit će RDN kao userattr=username, userdn, basedn gdje se userattr zamjenjuje vrijednošću koju upišete u ‘User attribute’, userdn vrijednošću koju upišete u ‘User DN’, basedn vrijednošću koju upišete u ‘base DN’</li><li><b>OpenLDAP bind</b> izgradit će RDN kao cn=username, basedn</li><li><b>Anonymous bind</b> izgradit će prazan RDN</li></ul>",
"Default: Anonymous Bind" => "Zadano: Anonimni bind",
"Full: userattr=username,UserDN,BaseDN" => "Full: userattr=username,UserDN,BaseDN",
"OpenLDAP: cn=username,BaseDN" => "OpenLDAP: cn=username,BaseDN",
"Active Directory (username@domain)" => "Active Directory (username@domain)",
"Plain Username" => "Obično korisničko ime",
"Search scope" => "Opseg pretrage",
