"Type of animation. Supported values: fade-up, fade-down, fade-left, fade-right, fade-up-right, fade-up-left, fade-down-right, fade-down-left, flip-left, flip-right, flip-up, flip-down, zoom-in, zoom-out, zoom-in-up, zoom-in-down, zoom-in-left, zoom-in-right, zoom-out-up, zoom-out-down, zoom-out-left, zoom-out-right" => "Vrsta animacije. Podržane vrijednosti: fade-up, fade-down, fade-left, fade-right, fade-up-right, fade-up-left, fade-down-right, fade-down-left, flip-left, flip-right, flip-up, flip-down, zoom-in, zoom-out, zoom-in-up, zoom-in-down, zoom-in-left, zoom-in-right, zoom-out-up, zoom-out-down, zoom-out-left, zoom-out-right",
