"Show a link to local files and directories. Access is denied unless system preference wikiplugin_fileaccess_allowed_paths defines allowed base paths" => "Prikaži poveznicu na lokalne datoteke i mape. Pristup je zabranjen osim ako postavka sustava wikiplugin_fileaccess_allowed_paths ne definira dopuštene osnovne putanje",
