"Or Filters" => "Ili filtri",
"Apply \"or\" filters to fields. Format: %0field:value;field:value;field:value%1,\n                    where %0field%1 may be the field name or ID depending on the setting for the %0byname%1 parameter" => "Primijenite \"ili\" filtre na polja. Format: %0field:value;field:value;field:value%1,\n                    gdje %0field%1 može biti naziv ili ID polja ovisno o postavci parametra %0byname%1",
