"website" => "web stranice",
"The script %0 that is included in the Tiki distribution can be run to make sure composer is installed and the file permissions are correctly applied. In this case, composer will be installed as %1" => "Skripta %0 uključena u Tiki distribuciju može se pokrenuti kako bi se osiguralo da je composer instaliran i da su dozvole datoteka ispravno postavljene. U tom slučaju composer će biti instaliran kao %1",
