"Some commands may need to determine the URL of the website and will not be able to do so reliably because fallbackBaseUrl is not set in the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tiki-admin.php?page=general\">admin</a>" => "Neke naredbe možda trebaju odrediti URL web-mjesta i to neće moći pouzdano učiniti jer fallbackBaseUrl nije postavljen u <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tiki-admin.php?page=general\">administraciji</a>",
