"Jobs" => "Zadaci",
"This page lists all scheduled background jobs along with their processing status. You can re-run a job or see a log of the job executions. Note that Tiki Scheduler must be executed periodically by a cron job in order to execute the background jobs. If you see a job in Active status below for too long interval, then your cron job is most probably not running. " => "Ova stranica prikazuje sve zakazane pozadinske zadatke zajedno s njihovim statusom obrade. Možete ponovno pokrenuti zadatak ili pogledati zapisnik izvršavanja zadatka. Napomena: Tiki planer mora se periodički izvršavati putem cron zadatka kako bi se izvršili pozadinski zadaci. Ako vidite zadatak u statusu Aktivan predugo, vaš cron zadatak vjerojatno ne radi. ",
